timestamp=2026-11-09T08:38:45.256Z level=INFO run=d54a47dc message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> /app/compute_answer.py << 'PY'\n\ndef median(x):\n    x = sorted(x)\n    n = len(x)\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        return x[n//2]\n    return (x[n//2 - 1] + x[n//2]) / 2.0\n\ndef mad(x):\n    med = median(x)\n    abs_dev = [abs(v - med) for v in x]\n    return median(abs_dev)\n\ndef robust_z(net, group_vals):\n    if len(group_vals) == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    med = median(group_vals)\n    m = mad(group_vals)\n    if m == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    return 0.6745 * (net - med) / m\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
